### Content (PDCA)

- **Purpose** — Caps horizontal visible actions at **3** (`MAX_VISIBLE_HORIZONTAL_ACTIONS`), aligned with `det-button-group-max.check.js` and the KS landing hero pattern from `components/components.py`.
- **Passing / failing signals** — Container selectors, severity (`major` / `critical`), and distinction from `DET.CTA.HIERARCHY` (count vs. class).
- **Before** — `landing-hero` / `landing-hero-actions__buttons` with five `.btn` links (`btn-forge`, `btn-cyan-outline`, `btn-forge-outline`, `btn-warning`).
- **After** — Two buttons plus `landing-hero-secondary-links` / `landing-hero-secondary-link` / `landing-hero-secondary-sep` (matches `landing_hero_fragment` output).
- **Evidence and remediation** — `metrics.buttonGroupMaxReport`, ordered fix steps, link to `analyze-website-ux.mjs`.

